00:02:15.712 --> 00:02:20.067
by researching accessibility needs,
exploring design solutions,

00:02:20.091 --> 00:02:22.035
and supporting the development of features

00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:25.422
for users with cognitive,
visual, and motor differences.

00:02:26.081 --> 00:02:30.140
With experience across
humanitarian and SaaS platforms,

00:02:30.164 --> 00:02:34.803
she brings research-backed, user-centered
thinking to designing interfaces

00:02:34.805 --> 00:02:36.008
that work for everyone.

